    {
      "id": "graph-construction",
      "title": {
        "zh": "构图智能体实验",
        "en": "Graph construction agent"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": {
            "zh": "以主键、外键（PK/FK）规则构图为基线，比较构图智能体优化图表示后，查询成本的下降幅度。优化查询集用于搜索和评估候选图表示，留出查询集用于检验这些改进在另一组查询上的表现。",
            "en": "The baseline graph is built using primary-key and foreign-key (PK/FK) rules. Results compare query cost after the construction agent optimizes the graph representation. Optimization queries guide the search and evaluation of candidate representations; held-out queries assess improvements on a separate query set."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "construction-results",
          "title": {
            "zh": "构图智能体与 PK/FK 规则构图对比",
            "en": "Construction agent versus PK/FK rule-based construction"
