            "zh": "对每个数据集，从提供的两组实验中选取优化成本和留出成本均更低的一组：Amazon、AVS 采用第一组，MAG、StackExchange 采用第二组。同一行的两项下降率均来自同一组实验，保留原表报告值；这里展示的是各数据集的最优结果汇总。",
            "en": "For each dataset, select the supplied result with lower costs on both optimization and held-out queries: the first result set for Amazon and AVS, and the second for MAG and StackExchange. Both reductions in a row come from the same result set and retain the reported values. This is a per-dataset best-result summary."
